1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,040
At first, everyone assumed the classic thread trick.

2
00:00:05,040 --> 00:00:11,130
A thin thread or fishing line, used to drop the latch from outside.

3
00:00:11,130 --> 00:00:17,010
But this latch is heavy, and no thread can hold that much force.

4
00:00:17,010 --> 00:00:22,890
The test showed the latch cannot drop without leaving a scratch.

5
00:00:22,890 --> 00:00:28,350
Theory two: a hidden tunnel running under the floorboards.

6
00:00:28,350 --> 00:00:34,370
The crew lifted every plank: solid reinforced concrete underneath.

7
00:00:34,370 --> 00:00:38,870
The case ran into a wall.

8
00:00:38,870 --> 00:00:44,470
People began to believe something beyond nature was at work.
